    "detailed_description": "<h1>WISHLIST NOW</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050710/extras/bcd2a45ebc6223d5f4d6a5e43f5cbe17.avif?t=1737100377\" /></div></p><br><h1>JOIN OUR DISCORD</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050710/extras/cbdecc9042781d7bdf504cc7467a6436.poster.avif?t=1737100377\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050710/extras/cbdecc9042781d7bdf504cc7467a6436.webm?t=1737100377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Narin: The Orange Room is a third-person adventure horror game. Play as Narin, a young girl whose sister mysteriously disappeared. According to rumors circulating among students in the school, those who haven't left before twilight mysteriously vanish.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050710/extras/fbd463709fbd2d782a96a272ce3dbb06.poster.avif?t=1737100377\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050710/extras/fbd463709fbd2d782a96a272ce3dbb06.webm?t=1737100377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050710/extras/fbd463709fbd2d782a96a272ce3dbb06.mp4?t=1737100377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Narin accidentally teleports into a grim dimension she never intended to enter. But she knows her sister might be there, so she chooses to stay.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050710/extras/835f864b64e2479f7413f4c9e435c6fd.poster.avif?t=1737100377\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050710/extras/835f864b64e2479f7413f4c9e435c6fd.webm?t=1737100377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050710/extras/835f864b64e2479f7413f4c9e435c6fd.mp4?t=1737100377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>In Twilight Dimension. She will encounter unknown creatures and discover the haunting stories of the Twilight Dimension. Narin may find an actual person who has long dwelled within here, receiving advice and instruction that may either aid Narin on her venture or lead her into even greater peril. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050710/extras/f7529724ba7fb5c5beffdbd8f6b6862c.poster.avif?t=1737100377\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050710/extras/f7529724ba7fb5c5beffdbd8f6b6862c.webm?t=1737100377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050710/extras/f7529724ba7fb5c5beffdbd8f6b6862c.mp4?t=1737100377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Help Narin fight, survive, and confront the horror. She needs to locate all the clues, solve puzzles, and delve further into the stories of her school. Help her in solving the mystery and finding her sister.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050710/extras/63fc5ec34d3d3f800addfb02c615ac16.poster.avif?t=1737100377\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050710/extras/63fc5ec34d3d3f800addfb02c615ac16.webm?t=1737100377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050710/extras/63fc5ec34d3d3f800addfb02c615ac16.mp4?t=1737100377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
