50710/extras/835f864b64e2479f7413f4c9e435c6fd.mp4?t=1737100377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>In Twilight Dimension. She will encounter unknown creatures and discover the haunting stories of the Twilight Dimension. Narin may find an actual person who has long dwelled within here, receiving advice and instruction that may either aid Narin on her venture or lead her into even greater peril. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050710/extras/f7529724ba7fb5c5beffdbd8f6b6862c.poster.avif?t=1737100377\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050710/extras/f7529724ba7fb5c5beffdbd8f6b6862c.webm?t=1737100377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050710/extras/f7529724ba7fb5c5beffdbd8f6b6862c.mp4?t=1737100377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Help Narin fight, survive, and confront the horror. She needs to locate all the clues, solve puzzles, and delve further into the stories of her school. Help her in solving the mystery and finding her sister.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050710/extras/63fc5ec34d3d3f800addfb02c615ac16.poster.avif?t=1737100377\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050710/extras/63fc5ec34d3d3f800addfb02c615ac16.webm?t=1737100377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050710/extras/63fc5ec34d3d3f800addfb02c615ac16.mp4?t=1737100377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
